              <l xml:id="m-6d57a3d5-ada2-4067-8f05-f5fbfa2c7cd4" facs="#m-15d5c5e2-0c07-4413-b3c9-fd803622d70f" label="ambiguous">February5.</l><l xml:id="m-2e0d7638-93b5-4830-9bfa-4c9d4b23bc52" facs="#m-e6a68afd-7be0-44fb-99a5-cd2952dc796f" label="ambiguous">1371</l><l xml:id="m-6ae7ef51-d872-4311-95e9-e2c4a77fb99a" facs="#m-71f0d6bb-3626-44e8-94d7-16d32cd1d102" label="lyrics-like">mé-a? Ego sum Apósto-lus Chrísti: ní-hil in me dúbi-tes,</l><l xml:id="m-7ddcc0b9-be39-4aea-94b7-f43cfdf5038d" facs="#m-e6180210-b3d4-4b51-93fb-b7e2c3994adf" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.4</l><l xml:id="m-835d911e-1fba-4bcf-a9b3-44d423e70738" facs="#m-c2f7d355-de9f-4995-81de-13e1d694cfc4" label="ambiguous">1.f</l><l xml:id="m-38eb0d86-551e-44a8-8607-ff022a65f083" facs="#m-637a445f-8313-4d44-a878-9aed8805dd06" label="lyrics-like">1Edi-cínam carná-lem</l><l xml:id="m-c6ad17c7-5711-488d-b23f-68ffda489b1b" facs="#m-1efdfdd8-43f1-49e8-ad84-e0e4df71b5ce" label="lyrics-like">fí-li-a.</l><l xml:id="m-a55d3e1a-c875-4a26-b382-ce0902f3f40c" facs="#m-4bc15f42-0293-45aa-ac9e-e17e652af849" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-36851249-6bf8-4646-8126-42f9f048333a" facs="#m-34f51a10-0cfe-4c47-8992-57960bc58266" label="lyrics-like">córpo-ri mé-o numquam exhíbu-i: sed hábe-o Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-24ba45ef-ee69-457b-accb-77f4ecf0dec0" facs="#m-469f39e2-15ab-4f06-98de-1db71ac1421f" label="lyrics-like">Jé-sum Chrí-stum, qui só-lo sermóne restáurat uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-f57bbeff-c087-49a1-992e-9dddb5d32b5a" facs="#m-1d1e88dc-09f0-4d07-a5fa-c6d0d0445a40" label="ambiguous">aAnt.</l><l xml:id="m-c5b47aee-5510-4295-9097-a2fbb25acca2" facs="#m-a564472e-e1b1-4d73-b882-6f83d3e67eca" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-4b217ce3-0c83-4174-bc14-787f75e3dbda" facs="#m-2796d025-8f9b-45fa-ade8-66c29b332c6c" label="lyrics-like">Rá-ti-as tibi ágo Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8f25818e-237e-4cd8-8509-3a0dd4594291" facs="#m-28be8fe0-3d4b-48db-98a1-8235c6b21fdd" label="lyrics-like">vérsa. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-c28e1096-72b3-490b-9d94-8e041ed2835c" facs="#m-c3317faf-b0e6-49d8-822a-fafa9452fea9" label="lyrics-like">ne, *qui-a mémor es mé-i, et mi-sísti ad me Apósto¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdbd72e7-545f-41e7-b36b-e0bb5d5ca04d" facs="#m-7a0531e9-6e00-4200-9a64-2097cd37fd0c" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8fbdfbb6-25e5-4001-8f3d-5a2a02403ef3" facs="#m-ba5b8f99-586e-4c0e-b52d-de0d588af6eb" label="lyrics-like">lum tú-um curá-re vúlne-ra mé¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-0e614625-d91a-4546-a2e5-03608d373dfd" facs="#m-98bfcf0e-eec9-433c-a831-9871696741de" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-77a92f96-cb50-4152-b812-8f109986221c" facs="#m-c735a4ff-eb60-44eb-8296-f17c8b4adc3f" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-03d80403-4b32-411e-aaea-7d2750ffddae" facs="#m-7b3c1c2c-cfe7-404b-8116-0dde7435e2b0" label="lyrics-like">Ene-dí-co te,“Pá-ter Dómini mé-i Jésu Chrísti:</l><l xml:id="m-75601f24-24f6-4ddf-98f6-673e64f85e59" facs="#m-31c978bd-6a46-4f07-98e7-31378a41ff15" label="lyrics-like">qui-a per Apósto-lum tú-um, mamillam mé-am mé-o pé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5cf81314-beec-45fb-ba32-dbdc506d46d5" facs="#m-06811a26-2c42-4cdc-b527-a8f510843c2d" label="ambiguous">5. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-3d982738-2cd5-4099-899d-082166be83d5" facs="#m-b27123ef-4fab-4ed8-8b39-c6824ba70f87" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-a0b39b71-e87c-4749-afe4-1a34233c9483" facs="#m-1f606841-f4e2-433d-b1c2-e1b600d4b6bd" label="lyrics-like">UI me digná¬</l><l xml:id="m-56b16b59-5af2-401f-bf52-80e6f7f276f5" facs="#m-da357425-2589-49e3-a2ca-a3c8330b5c2e" label="lyrics-like">tori resti-tu-í-sti.</l><l xml:id="m-cd3e0541-c546-46d0-904b-d8d7dd90dec4" facs="#m-6fd10a96-9bc5-4d2a-abe3-248750028f3a" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
